OL,3,GNEWSA'It's a bit odd at first': The
OL,4,Arobot helping with NHS health checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FGed Cashley suffered a cardiac arrest
OL,7,Fin 2018 and now has annual checks to
OL,8,Fmonitor his health.
OL,10,FThe 72-year-old's latest trip to the
OL,11,Fdoctor was a little different to his
OL,12,Fprevious ones.
OL,14,FHis GP practice in Dundee is trialling
OL,15,Fa 3ft-tall robot - called Teme - which
OL,16,Fglides across the waiting room and
OL,17,Ftakes him through a series of checks
OL,18,Fbefore he sees the doctor.
OL,20,F"It's a bit odd at first, but you soon
OL,21,Fget used to it," says Ged.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
